        "title": "The table below shows the results of surveys of people in the UK, carried out in three different decades. It shows the percentages of people who said they were interested in certain sports. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main ...",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LADCdIYCCos5nkx56WSlTVNcgWa\"><em><strong>The table below shows the results of surveys of people in the UK, carried out in three different decades. It shows the percentages of people who said they were interested in certain sports.</strong> <strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make a comparison where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Sports Interest in UK: Three Decades</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SaSKdM1JpoWdT8xr5WclDARzg0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Sports Interest in UK: Three Decades y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả tỷ lệ phần trăm những người cho biết họ quan t&acirc;m đến một số m&ocirc;n thể thao nhất định, trong một cuộc khảo s&aacute;t người d&acirc;n ở Anh, được thực hiện trong ba thập kỷ kh&aacute;c nhau.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xhs7d86SRoM5VWxMeeHl2lASgmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></a></strong><strong> </strong>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Sports Interest in UK: Three Decades với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: phần trăm người d&acirc;n UK - y&ecirc;u th&iacute;ch 6 m&ocirc;n thể thao - từ 1990 đến 2010.</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D9n2dT6reoUXRNx42urlLISBgH9\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IGyjdCCmNoNsJMxOIIblTD7wgPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends:&nbsp;</strong>football, golf v&agrave; judo giảm || rugby, cricket, v&agrave; swimming tăng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhBGdssNdoh7nBxbXBElrx25g2e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences:&nbsp;</strong>football lu&ocirc;n l&agrave; m&ocirc;n phổ biến nhất, thu h&uacute;t hơn nửa d&acirc;n số.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SX0BduN3Colr0qxzGQjl2lytg0e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Football, Golf, v&agrave; Judo</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0kDdgTi5oHVmsx4oORlw6WqgNg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B7SBdkZ1ootcksxHtVllAxqWglP\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1990 </strong><em>(football </em><em>dẫn đầu</em><em> với 59%, </em><em>cao hơn đ&aacute;ng kể</em><em> so với golf l&agrave; 28% v&agrave; judo với 9%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UlQvdsC4GoXHe5xN3ETlUj4ZgFe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của football </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm dần</strong></em><em> về 56% v&agrave;o năm 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BO6Mdc64KoJYSpxBZv6lWlClg6c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của golf </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>duy tr&igrave; ổn định</strong></em><em> trước khi </em><em><strong>giảm nhẹ</strong></em><em> xuống 26% v&agrave;o năm 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QY5Qd5ArFohuDbxt4jWlLJ8Fgrc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của judo </strong><em>(</em><em>giảm hơn một nửa</em><em> từ 9% xuống 4% sau 20 năm)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCSwdax9tomUUSxefRElcRiTgHc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Swimming</strong><strong>, </strong><strong>Rugby, v&agrave; Cricket</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCSwdax9tomUUSxefRElcRiTgHc\">Theo<strong> Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCSwdax9tomUUSxefRElcRiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BdBndssrJo9c6YxCfpvlgLsRgJE\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1)&nbsp;<strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1990 </strong><em>(swimming thu h&uacute;t 15%, </em><em>cao hơn một ch&uacute;t<strong> </strong></em><em>so với rugby v&agrave; cricket, đều 12%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ItDMdaIHvoKBqmxj6b0lX0ykgCg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của rugby </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng đ&aacute;ng kể nhất</strong></em><em>,</em><em> tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i</em><em> l&ecirc;n 24% v&agrave;o năm 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F0qHdin6HoO0H4xjbFclZ2w7ghc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của cricket </strong><em>(</em><em>tăng &iacute;t hơn<strong>,</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 14% v&agrave;o cuối giai đoạn)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Al9ndWqWKoeoHpx69cplTsVTg6p\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của swimming </strong><em>(</em><em>xu hướng chung l&agrave; tăng</em><em>, từ 15% l&ecirc;n 18% v&agrave;o 2000, mặc d&ugrave; </em><em><strong>giảm nhẹ</strong></em><em> về 16% v&agrave;o năm cuối)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKR6dLMaeoXxeTxrXRSlEEvNg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IyWPdWABBoH3aLxiL5dlyRargJb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Để diễn đạt &yacute; về sự y&ecirc;u th&iacute;ch d&agrave;nh cho m&ocirc;n thể thao, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng c&aacute;c cụm từ như \"<strong>express interest in something</strong>\" hay \"<strong>popularity</strong>\" để c&acirc;u văn m&igrave;nh đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VLK2dCTmxo8eBBxBmO4lCZStgcf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QPEsdeytqojwgbxjdEZlcn1FgCs\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The table illustrates the percentage of UK residents who <strong>expressed interest in</strong> six different sports over three decades, from 1990 to 2010.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YxXUd6NIdoJG3ixAQa3ltIjogqb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Overall, football, golf, and judo experienced declining <strong>popularity</strong> over the given period, while <strong>interest in</strong> rugby, cricket, and swimming showed an upward trend.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
